# Day-to-day: ETL / data pipeline: sources fan in to staging, transformations, warehouse and BI fan out.
title "ETL pipeline"
dir RIGHT
crm[(CRM)]
erp[(ERP)]
logs[Clickstream logs]
stage[Staging area] :orange
clean[Clean and dedupe]
join[Join and enrich]
wh[(Data warehouse)] :teal
bi[BI dashboards] :green
ml[ML features] :purple
crm, erp, logs -> stage : extract
stage -> clean -> join : transform
join -> wh : load
wh -> bi
wh -> ml
join --> stage : rejects
